  "bodyHtml": "<div class=\"h1-custom-style\"><h1>SUPREME PLUS PRESSURE VESSEL</h1></div><div id=\"pd-container-01\" class=\"container-fluid\">\n\t<div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"pd-aquasky-text\"><div class=\"h1-1\"><img src=\"/images/products/supreme/supreme_logo.png\" class=\"img-responsive\" alt=\"\"></div></div>\n      <h2 class=\"h2_2hline lang_rtl\">About SUPREME-PLUS Pressure Vessel - Inter - Changeable Bladder Tank</h2>\n\t    <div class=\"pd-about-text txt-align-justify lang_rtl\">SupremePlus series offers large-sized pressure vessels (up to 10,000L) providing high drawdown in water. It comes with an interchangeable bladder and a flange with stainless water connection. SupremePlus serves well in many applications such as Surge tanks, Long range irrigation, or HVAC expansion purposes. SupremePlus comes with a carbon steel body(standard) and pre-charged with Nitrogen. Nitrogen, due to its stability and larger molecular size, has better resistance to air per\u0002meation and less pressure variance from temperature difference. SupremePlus series vessels are composed according to the PED or ASME VIII-Div. I standard. The latest weld\u0002ing technology is applied to the production. All vessels have to pass two quality inspections stages to obtain the necessary quality assurance certificate.</div>\n\n      <p>&nbsp;</p>\n      <p>&nbsp;</p>\n      <div id=\"ImgAutoResponsive\" class=\"lang_rtl\">\n        <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" src=\"/upfile/Images/SUPREME-PLUS/Supermeplus_DM-040323-WEB-1.jpg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" src=\"/upfile/Images/SUPREME-PLUS/Supermeplus_DM-040323-WEB-2.jpg\"></p>      </div>\n  \t</div>\n\t<div id=\"pd-more-info\" class=\"container\">\n  \t\t<h2 class=\"h2_2hline h2_2hline_margin lang_rtl\">Product Line</h2>\n\n<div id=\"other_pd_line\" cl